        "id": 220702,
        "name": "Ameena",
        "username": "Ameena",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-07-28T08:48:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Wilds only prevents the Explore action - it would have no effect on placing a Town due to an Event or Build, I'm afraid. The land with Wilds is just as valid a location as any other for your Town placement. Unless you meant Disease...in which case as far as I'm aware that still only blocks the Build action, so I think it would only get to prevent Town placement if the Event specifies \"Invaders Build in X land\", not just \"add a Town to X land\" or similar.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:53:14.342Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
