        "created_at": "2018-07-28T15:21:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The question is presumably about the event that has you place one town instead of an explorer when exploring. Wilds might prevent them from exploring into one land, but if they successfully explored into another land, you would have to place the town there.</p>",
